  <description>
    <p>Nova DM is a download manager for Linux with a clean interface. It uses aria2 for fast, resumable downloads split into several connections.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Queue with pause, resume, retry and a manual order you can change by dragging</li>
      <li>Sortable columns: name, size, type, progress, status, speed and time left</li>
      <li>Drag links onto the window to add them</li>
      <li>Optional Firefox extension that sends browser downloads to Nova DM, opening the app if needed</li>
      <li>Interface in 35 languages</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Nova DM never starts a download by itself without you adding it, and it does not collect any data.</p>
  </description>
